<title>USA: TABLE-M.G. Products Inc Q2 shr loss rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-M.G. Products Inc Q2 shr loss rises.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.37     loss	 $0.30</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,289     loss	 3,132</p>
<p> Revs			 2,690		    4,440</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,206		   10,564</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q2 1997 included a charge of $2.8 million for restructuring efforts. Q2 1996 included a charge of $800,000 for restructuring.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
